OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CSubstance released at concert could be 
OL,5,Clinked to robberies, police say        
OL,6,GAn "unknown substance" that prompted a 
OL,7,Gmass evacuation at a rap concert may   
OL,8,Gbe linked to robberies and stolen      
OL,9,Gjewellery at the venue, police have    
OL,10,Gsaid.                                  
OL,12,FMore than 12,000 people were evacuated 
OL,13,Ffrom Manchester's Co-op Live during a  
OL,14,Fperformance by US rapper Don Toliver   
OL,15,Fon Sunday.                             
OL,17,FOne person was taken to hospital and   
OL,18,F88 others were treated at the scene    
OL,19,Fafter concertgoers reported a          
OL,20,F"horrible smell" and some people       
OL,21,F"coughing up blood".                   
